# Rosel the Armorer (sandoria 2), the draw's range: available, Prog 1 set by GM (524's arm: its finish with option 1
# does nothing, so the quest stays available). Forty draws in a row: before each, Stage 0 (a GM), then Rosel's talk
# draws math.randomInt(1, 2) from the seeded RNG's next numbers, sets Stage and plays 524 (0, 0, 0, 0, Stage - 1).
# The draws are 1, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 2, 1, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 2, 1, 2, 1,
# 2, 1, 2, 2, 1 (21 ones, 19 twos; Stage is the draw, 524's fifth param the draw - 1, trimmed when 0): both 1 and 2
# occur, so randomInt(1, 1) differs at draw 5 and randomInt(2, 2) at draw 1. Outside the range: on this stream
# randomInt(0, 2) differs at draw 1 (a 0: Stage unset, the param -1) and randomInt(1, 3) at draw 3, so a range that
# starts below 1 or stops above 2 differs as well (each mutant replayed and failed).
lists SouthernSanDoria/Rosel/onTrigger SouthernSanDoria/onEventFinish/524
char zone=SouthernSanDoria pos=71.4,0.0,41.1 job=WAR lvl=30
charvar Quest[0][2]Prog 1
login
charvar Quest[0][2]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Rosel                             # draw 1: 1, Stage 1; 524 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=1                           # Prog 1, option 1: nothing
charvar Quest[0][2]Stage 0              # a GM
trigger Rosel                             # draw 2: 1, Stage 1; 524 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0)
finish option=1                           # Prog 1, option 1: nothing
charvar Quest[0][2]Stage 0              # a GM
